ould be. As they say, tooth is in the eye of the B molar.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T01:56:37-07:00","id":1069932,"title":"","content":"It would be interesting to see some modified humans with angelic parts installed.<br /> <br /> in my game right now I have a few humans who are being installed with demonic forms to bring them closer to being beyond humans.<br /> <br /> Also the cults. Hmmm what happens when demons mess with the abyss that would be interesting.<br /> <br /> Also the idea of Angelic gadgets for mortals would be interest but I don't think would be called gadgets maybe relics no just Devices","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 03-29-2017, 05:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-29T19:15:38-07:00","id":1070435,"title":"","content":"I was afraid this would never be a thing! Here's hoping we get lots of uncategorized weirdness in this book; while there's nothing wrong with Angels and Cryptids, I'm much more interesting in a supplement like this bringing new threats to the line. Remember that the Strix and Idigam both had their big breaks in supplements originally.<br /> <br /> <i>maybe someday Mummy will get a Night Horrors</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game d